   226	        // Only targets with visible area can conflict with each other. Without this filter a control
   227	        // scrolled entirely out of view still reports a 0 dp gap against the one at the window edge,
   228	        // which is the same mistake the per-target checks already avoid.
   229	        val visible = controls.filter { it.isVisible }
